愣，说只有刀币，说着便拿出七个银刀币来，唐小虾有些尴尬，不过也点点头表示也行，便拿起这七个刀币用双手搓着，嘴中振振有词，只是他说的话声音很小，洛思琪用心去听也听不清是什么，只见他猛的往桌上一扔，便对伍胥说道：“您看，七个里有五个刀冲南方，说明南方有刀兵之祸，为了安全，我劝您最近几个月切不可往南走了！”“南方，南方。”伍胥在嘴中小声念着，突然问：“您是说国都么？”这时候唐小虾反而装起神秘了，对他说道：“天机不可泄露，我只能说是南方，伍兄您自己思量吧！”伍胥知道再问无益，道了个谢，整顿饭吃下来却显得心事更加重了。席间洛思琪忍不住问他：“伍大哥，看你心事重重的，一定有很多麻烦事要解决，你的志向是什么啊？”伍胥听到这话，眼中的忽然展现出了光彩，洛思琪听他说道：“我从小就和父亲学兵书，学剑术，长大了替父亲做一些国事也对治国有了更深的了解，我将来自然要像祖父和父亲一样成为国之柱石，为大王开疆扩土，为民治水解忧！”“好，好，好，好志向！来，为伍员的话大家喝一碗！”纯真听到这里便端起水酒让大家喝，洛思琪从不喝酒，侍女给她倒的是野蜂蜜调成的糖水，她跟着喝了一碗，听见喝光水酒的唐小虾又叹了口气。伍胥不解道：“唐兄可是觉得我的志向有何不妥之处？”唐小虾苦笑了一下说道：“没有，没有，只是希望你别忘了今天的话！”“男儿志向何敢忘！”伍胥说到志向便意气风发起来，之前的苦闷一扫而空，他又喝了一碗，说到：“就算有天大的困难，伍某也必报效大王，辅佐太，强楚称霸！”洛思琪听到这里，在内心也忍不住叹气了。伍胥走后洛思琦问唐小虾为何占卜的事，唐小虾见只有两人便告诉她说：“今天一和伍胥对话我就知道他还未遭遇大难，你看他现在，还一门心思的想报效楚国，我们突然来到这里，也不知道怎样才能回去，他在遇到勾践前一直运势强，现在和他说南方有险情，让他信我，以后也许会用得到。”洛思琪是感到很是匪夷所思，她对唐小虾说：“你想的也太多啦！”正要再说些什么，小师弟过来对她和唐小虾说：“师兄师姐，师父有事找你们！”洛思琪便和唐小虾去见伍胥口中的清元了，因为见伍胥的关系，她还有很多事没有问这个老头呢，她也不知道这老头能不能告诉她和唐小虾回去的办法，不过看来这老头这么突然的把自己和唐小虾弄来，估计也不会很轻易的让两人走了。见到清元后唐小虾便问他回去的办法，清元苦着脸的样很好笑，他近似哀求的对唐小虾说：“你看我一大把年纪千辛万苦把你们弄来，你这么快就想走，抛下我这么一个毫无还手能力的老人给那些家伙，你说你于心何忍啊！”唐小虾想了想便坐下了，他对清元说：“你是说我梦见的那两个要杀你的人么？你和我说说他们两个到底是什么来头，等我帮你解决了他们，你可一定要送我和洛思琪回去啊！”", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/laidaochunqiudangyueshen/4.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 3 Meeting Wu Zixu for the First Time (Third Update) Before meeting Wu Xu, Luo Siqi asked Tang Xiaoxia how much he knew about Wu Xu. Tang Xiaoxia said: \"I just know that we are in the Spring and Autumn Period and the Warring States Period. You know, you know, the reason why Gou Jian is like this is because Wu Xu has become stronger than the Wu State, but he doesn't know what period Wu Xu is in now. ~\" The maids brought them ancient clothes to change into. Chunzhen said they were afraid that Wu Xu would be scared when he saw their outfits, so Luo Siqi and Tang Xiaoxia changed into them. The maids used a comb to comb Luo Siqi's hair. The back of the comb was arc-shaped and had symmetrical patterns on the body. Luo Siqi looked very interesting, but refused the maids to insert it into her hair for decoration. The two of them were dressed up not only with pearls on their feet and gold and jade on their waists. Both he and Luo Siqi's shoes were made of deerskin, woven with silk strands, which looked extremely exquisite. Luo Siqi's cuffs were also inlaid with fur to make peaks, which was not hot but extremely beautiful. The maids also brought Luo Siqi a necklace made of pearls and agate. Luo Siqi chose a string of pearls and put it on her neck, which made her look even more dazzling. As for the ring, Luo Siqi didn't ask for it, but Tang Xiaoxia chose a silver one to wear instead of gold. After the two of them had dressed up, their junior brother also came to inform them to meet the guests. The food and wine were placed on a stone table next to the river. From a distance, Luo Siqi saw a young man in dark green clothes with his back to the stone table looking at the water in the river. He seemed to be thinking about something with his head lowered. He had a long sword hanging on his waist, which made him look particularly heroic. Chunzhen walked over to him first and said : \"Don't worry, Mr. Wu, come on, come on, let me introduce my two disciples to you!\" Tang Xiaoxia glanced at Innocence with disdain, as if she didn't approve of being his disciple. Luo Siqi was not willing at first, but the clothes and accessories were so beautiful, and she was dressed as if she was filming a movie. She thought of Louis Koo's \"Xun Qin Ji\", wasn't it from this era? At that time, I thought it would be great if I could come to the Spring and Autumn and Warring States Period to meet Qin Shihuang. Now I finally came, but it seemed to be much earlier than Qin Shihuang's time. ~When Wu Xu turned around, she found that this was another handsome guy, but this handsome guy was almost 27 or 28 years old. There was melancholy in his eyes, and he didn't know what he was worried about. However, he quickly smiled, and after being introduced one by one by innocence, he saluted the two of them. Luo Siqi and Tang Xiaoxia also hurriedly returned the courtesy, and the four of them sat down in their respective seats. Chunzhen asked him, \"Are you still worried about state affairs?\" Wu Xu sighed: \"Yes, sir, ever since Fei Wuji dedicated his daughter Qin who was the queen to the king in order to please the king, he was afraid of the queen's revenge after he succeeded to the throne, so he spoke ill of the queen day and night in front of the king, so that the queen had to leave the capital and go to the city to guard the border. That's it, I'm afraid his slander will get worse day by day!\" Luo Siqi looked at Tang Xiaoxia, and she heard Tang Xiaoxia sigh, and Wu Xu quickly asked: \"Brother Tang, why are you sighing?\" Tang Xiaoxia shook his head slightly and said to Wu Xu, \"I'm not talented, but I know some divination magic, how about letting me make a prediction for Brother Wu?\" Luo Siqi was very surprised, she wondered why Tang Xiaoxia suddenly knew fortunes? Wu Xu, on the other hand, looked like he was getting what he wanted, and said: \"Mr. Qingyuan's beloved disciple is a master, and I can't get what I want. (·~ )\" Tang Xiaoxia then asked Wu Xu to ask for seven copper coins. In the Spring and Autumn Period of Chu, money mostly consisted of knife coins and shell coins. Wu Xu was stunned and said that he only had knife coins. He then took out seven silver knife coins. Tang Xiaoxia was a little embarrassed, but he nodded and said it was fine. , he picked up the seven coins and rubbed them with both hands, speaking plausibly, but his voice was very low, and Luo Siqi couldn't hear what they were even if she tried to listen. She saw him throw it on the table fiercely, and said to Wu Xu: \"Look, seven li There are five swords rushing to the south, indicating that there is a danger of swords and soldiers in the south. For the sake of safety, I advise you not to go south in the past few months!\" \"South, south.\" Wu Xu whispered in his mouth, and suddenly asked: \"Are you talking about the capital?\" Instead, Hou Tang Xiaoxia pretended to be mysterious and said to him: \"The secret must not be revealed. I can only say it is the south. Brother Wu, you can think about it yourself!\" Wu Xu knew that it would be useless to ask further, so he thanked him, but he seemed to be more worried after eating the whole meal. During the dinner, Luo Siqi couldn't help but ask him: \"Brother Wu, seeing how worried you are, you must have a lot of troubles to solve. What is your ambition?\" When Wu Xu heard this, his eyes suddenly showed brilliance. Luo Siqi heard him say: \"I have studied military arts and swordsmanship with my father since I was a child. When I grew up, I did some national affairs for my father and gained a deeper understanding of the country. I will naturally be like him in the future. My grandfather, like my father, became the pillar of the country, opened up new territories for the king, and relieved the people's worries! \"Okay, okay, okay, what a great ambition! Come on, let's have a bowl of water and wine for everyone to drink!\" When she heard this, Luo Siqi never drank. The maid poured her a bowl of sugar water made from wild honey. She drank a bowl and heard Tang Xiaoxia sigh again after finishing the water and wine. Wu Xu asked in confusion: \"Brother Tang, what do you think is wrong with my ambition?\" Tang Xiaoxia smiled bitterly and said, \"No, no, I just hope you don't forget what I said today!\" \"How dare you forget your ambition!\" Wu Xu said with a smile. He became energetic and the previous depression was gone. He drank another bowl and said: \"Even if there are huge difficulties, Wu will serve the king, assist the queen, and dominate Chu!\" Luo Siqi couldn't help but sigh in her heart when she heard this. After Wu Xu left, Luo Siqi asked Tang Xiaoxia why she did the divination. Seeing that there were only two people, Tang Xiaoxia told her: \"As soon as I talked to Wu Xu today, I knew that he had not encountered a disaster yet. Look at him now, he still wants to serve the Chu State. We came here suddenly, and we don't know how to go back. He", "title_en": "Chapter 4"}